# =============================================================================
# CRITICAL - leaking any of these leaks credentials or live sessions.
# =============================================================================

# Browser profiles: cookies and localStorage of logged-in game accounts.
# The app never writes here in dev (config/logs live in %APPDATA%/hecaton),
# but profiles are data dirs by design.
data/
profiles/

# Playwright artifacts. Playwright is NOT part of this stack (the target game's
# Cloudflare Turnstile rejects CDP-controlled browsers - see docs/architecture.md),
# but these stay as defense in depth: traces record requests WITH headers, i.e.
# cookies and tokens, and reports embed screenshots. Costs nothing to keep.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/
playwright/.cache/

# Serialized cookies + localStorage.
storageState.json
storage-state.json
*.storageState.json

# Code-signing certificates (phase 3). Leaking these is worse than leaking a
# session: it lets a third party sign malware as if it were this app.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.cer
*.crt

# GH_TOKEN (release publishing), CSC_LINK / CSC_KEY_PASSWORD (signing).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Screenshots of a logged-in game expose account name, e-mail and resources.
screenshots/
captures/

# Chromium Crashpad writes process memory, which can contain session data.
# Most of it lands inside data/, but be explicit.
crashes/
Crashpad/
*.dmp

# =============================================================================
# BUILD OUTPUT AND DEPENDENCIES
# =============================================================================
node_modules/
dist/
out/
build/
release/
*.exe
*.blockmap
*.nsis
*.nsis.7z
latest*.yml

# =============================================================================
# TOOLING
# =============================================================================
# Session handoff between Claude Code sessions: ephemeral working state whose
# durable content lives in committed docs (see docs/plans/). Never committed.
.claude/handoff.md
# Disposable probe code (Phase-0-style spikes). Findings are recorded in
# docs/plans/ and ADRs; the code itself never ships and never enters git.
spike/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
.vite/
.turbo/

# =============================================================================
# OS AND EDITOR NOISE
# =============================================================================
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.shared.json
